    "spectral_lower_half_dimensionless_vs_rho_nabla": 0.4999999999999474,
    "lower_half_added_mass_kg": 1073.3774899763996,
    "note": "the spectral projector integrates the translating-sphere potential over the lower hemisphere, so it returns the half-space (hemisphere) value directly: 0.5 rho*nabla in rho*nabla units; the closed-form full sphere is 1.0 in the same units, and halving it for the half-space gives the same 1/2"
